225
00:11:09,100 --> 00:11:10,140
No, no.
不，不。

226
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:11,740
You're my lobster.
你是我的龍蝦。

227
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:13,640
See, um...
瞧，嗯...

228
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:14,860
Lobsters...
龍蝦...

229
00:11:15,460 --> 00:11:18,340
In the tank, when they're old...
在魚缸裡，當他們老了...

230
00:11:18,900 --> 00:11:20,200
They get with the...
他們與...

231
