Wow, you are really getting good at that Marcel Marceau thing.
哇，你真的很擅長馬塞爾馬索的事。

267
00:12:47,500 --> 00:12:49,540
Hey, listen, what do you say we play some ball?
嘿，聽著，你說我們打個球怎麼樣？

268
00:12:49,620 --> 00:12:50,220
