這對我來說意味著什麼？

275
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:07,920
Well, what about the fact that you insulted the bracelet
好吧，那你侮辱手鐲的事實又如何呢？

276
00:13:07,920 --> 00:13:09,340
and you made fun of me?
你還取笑我？

277
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:11,800
Okay, well, that's the part where I'm a wank.
好吧，這就是我自慰的部分。

278
00:13:13,660 --> 00:13:15,980
But I was hoping, you know, we wouldn't focus on that.
但我希望，你知道，我們不會注意這一點。

279
00:13:16,420 --> 00:13:16,740
Oh, yeah?
哦，是嗎？

280
00:13:17,380 --> 00:13:18,600
Well, focus on this.
嗯，重點關注這一點。

281
00:13:22,920 --> 00:13:23,940
Hard to argue with that.
很難反駁這一點。

282
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:27,580
Hey, come on, man.
嘿，來吧，夥計。

283
00:13:27,760 --> 00:13:29,440
I said I was sorry like a hundred times.
我說了一百遍對不起。

284
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:32,040
I promise I will never take it off my...
我保證我永遠不會把它從我的...

285
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:33,520
wrist.
