286
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:39,400
But if you want to stay in there and be mad, you know,
但如果你想待在那裡發瘋，你知道，

287
00:13:39,520 --> 00:13:41,540
you just, uh, you stay in there.
你只是，呃，你待在那裡。

288
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,260
You know what?
你知道嗎？

289
00:13:44,740 --> 00:13:46,500
I am here on my knees
我跪在這裡

290
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:50,040
